<p>1) Sure, changing the class.</p>
<p>2) Good point, I will edit that in a minute.</p>
<p>3) I thought about that for a while after posting the idea, like maybe the damage would be transfered to the owner, maybe it has a &quot;reload&quot; time, maybe&#8230;; Yes, it has some sapience, but interactions would be difficult as you could only hear his voice when you hug him. And when I tried to make the &quot;where would the kid try to go&quot;, I thought like &quot;Fantasy land&quot;, but immediately I remembered <a href="/scp-1762">SCP-1762</a> and tried to change the name to not interfere on other's articles. But a &quot;crossover&quot; could be a good idea.</p>
<p>Thanks for pointing those out, I'm working on them right now.</p>

